Tables of the CIE, each written in Lean with every value unchanged:

- Source/Presentation/Colorimetry/Observer.lean: CIE (2019),
  Colour-matching functions of CIE 1931 standard colorimetric observer,
  International Commission on Illumination (CIE), Vienna,
  https://doi.org/10.25039/CIE.DS.xvudnb9b, licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
- Source/Presentation/Colorimetry/Illuminant.lean: CIE (2019), CIE standard
  illuminant D65, International Commission on Illumination (CIE), Vienna,
  https://doi.org/10.25039/CIE.DS.hjfjmt59, licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.

Validation values from the metadata of the same data sets, each written in
Lean with every value unchanged:

- Test/Presentation/Colorimetry/Observer.lean: the validation values of CIE
  (2019), Colour-matching functions of CIE 1931 standard colorimetric
  observer, https://doi.org/10.25039/CIE.DS.xvudnb9b, licensed under
  CC BY-SA 4.0.
- Test/Presentation/Colorimetry/Illuminant.lean: the validation values of CIE
  (2019), CIE standard illuminant D65,
  https://doi.org/10.25039/CIE.DS.hjfjmt59, licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
- Test/Presentation/Colorimetry/Tristimulus.lean: the validation values of CIE
  (2019), Colour-matching functions of CIE 1931 standard colorimetric
  observer, https://doi.org/10.25039/CIE.DS.xvudnb9b, licensed under
  CC BY-SA 4.0.
